gs that the democrats  want to emphasize is the idea that joe  biden represents a kind of old-timey  unity  which means reaching out to the other  party which means  representing or at least listening to  diverse viewpoints and part of what  they're trying to do is build an  appetite for something that hasn't been  on the menu for a while  which is this idea of unity i don't  think it's going to be  a huge lasting impact but it it it is  part of  what they're trying to do which is  define the turf they want this election  to be  on their argument is donald trump has  done everything to keep the country  unified and they wanted to have a kind  of tableau of unity  and in that case having everybody from  john kasich to bernie sanders  suggests that that kind of broad unity  all right john dickerson  as always good to see you my dentist dr  messiah says it's not good to grind your  teeth  so they need to stop doing that thank  you thank you john dickerson thank you  bye
 

